# Prisma
# Ensure generated clients are ignored
packages/database/node_modules/
**/.prisma/
# Ensure schemas and migrations are explicitly tracked (overrides any broad ignores)
!packages/database/prisma/**/*.prisma
!packages/database/prisma/**/migrations/
